Package: craft-updater
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Markus <wildcardcharacter@icloud.com>
Depends: python3, python3-tk, dpkg, apt, pkexec
Description: GUI updater for ArtCraft applications
 CraftUpdater checks upstream releases and installs matching Debian packages
 through the system package manager.
